#: ../../source/docs/common-durandal-overview.rst:565
#: 953f543849d94d2283cc9499eeb9fd59
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RCIN pin, at one end of the servo rail, marked"
" RCIN in the above diagram. This pin supports all RC protocols. In addition "
"there is a dedicated Spektrum satellite port which supports software power "
"control, allowing for binding of Spektrum satellite receivers."
msgstr ""
"遥控输入配置在舵机总线一端的 RCIN 引脚上，在上图中标记为 RCIN。该引脚支持所有遥控协议。此外，还有一个专用的 Spektrum "
"卫星接口，支持软件电源控制，可对 Spektrum 卫星接收机进行绑定。"

