#: ../../source/docs/common-durandal-overview.rst:574
#: f52117ef7b41442180365a1ae4e5b4b9
msgid ""
"The Durandal supports up to 16 PWM outputs. First first 8 outputs (labelled "
"\"MAIN\") are controlled by a dedicated STM32F100 IO controller. These 8 "
"outputs support all PWM output formats, but not DShot."
msgstr ""
"Durandal 最多支持 16 路 PWM 输出。前 8 路输出（标记为「MAIN」）由专用的 STM32F100 IO 控制器控制，支持所有 PWM"
" 输出格式，但不支持 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-durandal-overview.rst:578
#: b3db8985f4344f668797481b54bf1279
msgid ""
"The remaining 8 outputs (labelled AUX1 to AUX8) are the \"auxiliary\" "
"outputs. These are directly attached to the STM32H743 and support all PWM "
"protocols as well as DShot."
msgstr "其余 8 路输出（标记为 AUX1 至 AUX8）为「辅助」输出，直接连接到 STM32H743，支持所有 PWM 协议以及 DShot。"

