msgid "PWM 7 and 8 in group6 (no DMA, no DShot)"
msgstr "PWM 7 和 8 在 group6（无 DMA，不支持 DShot）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-durandal-overview.rst:597
#: b18dc77057634cd88974336450707a71
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-durandal-overview.rst:602
#: 4fc8c8957b5842ad8cfc81e76cadfee6
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
